{"unit_id":"weiplwei__DeepSeek-chan-sleep-shutdown#card-zh","repo":"weiplwei/DeepSeek-chan-sleep-shutdown","commit":"3a2e4418419792e179968a744467290ad013778b","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DeepSeek-chan Sleep Shutdown 是面向 DeepSeek Harness 网页端的任务完成关机插件。它在页面注入可拖动的鲸鱼娘按钮，并通过会话状态事件判断所有根会话是否空闲。开启后可在任务完成时启动可取消的关机倒计时，显示进度环和提示横幅；新任务开始时可中断倒计时，也能设置是否仅在任务成功时关机。适合运行长任务后希望自动关闭电脑的 Windows 用户。需要 Windows 系统，使用前无需 API 密钥或外部账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:516-540","index.js:621-647","index.js:694-753","cordis.patch.yml:1-5"]}
{"unit_id":"weiplwei__DeepSeek-chan-sleep-shutdown#card-en","repo":"weiplwei/DeepSeek-chan-sleep-shutdown","commit":"3a2e4418419792e179968a744467290ad013778b","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DeepSeek-chan Sleep Shutdown adds a draggable whale button to the Harness web interface. When armed, it starts a cancellable shutdown countdown after root sessions finish; new work interrupts it. Users can choose whether errors block shutdown. For Windows users; no API key or account is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:516-540","index.js:621-647","index.js:694-753","cordis.patch.yml:1-5"]}
