{"unit_id":"weiplwei__DeepSeek-chan-sleep-shutdown#feature-1","repo":"weiplwei/DeepSeek-chan-sleep-shutdown","commit":"3a2e4418419792e179968a744467290ad013778b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DeepSeek-chan Sleep Shutdown 的功能「任务完成后关机」：开启按钮后，插件等待所有根会话空闲，并按成功条件判断是否启动倒计时；倒计时结束后发送系统关机命令。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:585-595","index.js:621-647"]}
