{"unit_id":"weiplwei__DeepSeek-chan-sleep-shutdown#caveat-1","repo":"weiplwei/DeepSeek-chan-sleep-shutdown","commit":"3a2e4418419792e179968a744467290ad013778b","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"DeepSeek-chan Sleep Shutdown 使用前须知：插件仅在 Windows 上启用关机功能，其他平台会保持惰性；其按钮需要在 DSH 网页重新加载后注入显示。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:528-531","index.js:738-742"]}
